  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9TYytCO.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"189\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kc2YGgk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/554379889122213888.svg?label=加入我們的Discord社群&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Additions 是 Mekanism 的官方擴充模組，為 Mekanism 添加了更多雜項功能。這些功能大多曾在 1.12 及更早版本的主模組中出現，後來被移至此模組中。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">功能：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">幼年生物：</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 苦力怕</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 終界使者</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 骷髏</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 流髑</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 凋零骷髏</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">黑曜石 TNT</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">發光面板</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">氣球</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">各種形狀的塑料方塊變種</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">語音伺服器</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">其他 Mekanism 模組連結：</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Generators</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Tools</span></a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>說明文件</strong>&nbsp;可在 Mekanism 的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwiki.aidancbrady.com%252fwiki%252fMain_Page\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方維基</a>找到，由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.indiewikis.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">IndieWikis</a> 自豪地託管！這仍是一項進行中的工作，如果您有能力，請務必貢獻一份心力！</p><p><strong>原始碼&nbsp;</strong>可在 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/mekanism-mod/Mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong> 上取得！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>透過 Patreon 支持開發團隊&nbsp;</strong>：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=260704\" rel=\"nofollow\">aidancbrady</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/pupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>透過 Ko-fi 支持開發團隊&nbsp;</strong>：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p>",
